 <ls>Sk.</ls> on the outside of, with the exception of. In these senses {#apa#}
 may form adverbial compounds also (<ls>P. II. 1. 12</ls>); {#˚vizRu saMsAraH#} <ls>Sk.</ls>
 without Viṣṇu; {#˚trigartaM vfzwo devaH#} excepting {#trigarta#} <ab>&c.</ab>
